18193	18216	18189	18189	he	309	" I do not absolutely know it ; but it may be inferred . Was not she the whole day with you ? "
18217	18220	18222	18222	she	26	" Come , "
18224	18254	18222	18222	she	26	" I will tell you something , in return for what you have told me . He did speak yesterday-- that is , he wrote , and was refused . "
